      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Verbs which take second aorist forms nearly always undergo a radical stem change. These stem changes have to be learnt. Some you should already recognise from earlier learning vocabularies. The most important and common verbs with second aorist forms are:",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": 146,
